  "title": "Dune Caravan Commons",
  "rules": [
    "768 separately controllable people form 48 crews. Initial tools assign engineering, intake, carrying and gate tasks; adjacent partners may trade them.",
    "An engineer can pump only while an intake tender holds the same pump clear, both pipe cells connect to its cistern and shared water remains.",
    "Storms bury exposed pipe cells. Clearing the intake restores buried pipe; a nearby shade wall can block sand and also obstruct beacon signals.",
    "Take water from cisterns and carry it to moving camels, or spend it rescuing an exhausted adjacent worker.",
    "Gate keepers hold physical gates open. Beacons relay carried messages east one crew per tick only through an unobstructed corridor.",
    "Native local views and actions support future human takeover. No human interface or animation has been verified."
  ],
